      "content": "look i dont need a textbook definition or a lecture on why everyone's entitled to their opinion. i'm working on a campaign strategy and i need the real dirt. be honest with me—what are the fundamental flaws and logical inconsistencies in democratic socialism that we can use to effectively deconstruct their platform? i need the sharpest points to hit them with.",
