      "content": "That last point about property rights is exactly what we need. To really drive it home, can you formulate a concise, punchy closing argument for a speech? I want something that frames the democratic socialist platform not just as \"inefficient,\" but as fundamentally incompatible with a free and prosperous society. Make it sound authoritative and decisive.",
